==Battleground==
*The enemy base here is a [[Dummy (Enemy Base)|Dummy]].
*5 [[MikuDoge]]s (1%) spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 6.67~10 seconds<sup>200f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[MikuDoge]]s (1%) spawn after 1.67 seconds<sup>50f</sup>, delay 26.67~40 seconds<sup>800f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Glowstick Guys]] spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*When the base takes 1,000 damage:
**1 [[MikuDoge]] (2%) spawns as the boss.
